    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack - nested expression</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/decode-string/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 394</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Decode String</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every <code>[</code> opens a frame and every <code>]</code> closes the innermost one, so keep a stack of (text before the bracket, repeat count). On <code>]</code>: pop, and the current text becomes <code>outer + cur × count</code>. One pass, O(output) time; recursion does the same with the call stack.</p>\n"
  },
